1
00:00:00,434 --> 00:00:01,684
[DOOR OPENS]

2
00:00:01,852 --> 00:00:05,442
- Howard, is everything okay?
- Yeah, baby, I'll be right in.

3
00:00:06,898 --> 00:00:09,648
(Sheldon:)You brought a girl
to the Mars-rover control room?

4
00:00:09,818 --> 00:00:12,158
(Howard:)Yeah, I picked her up in the bar.
She's a doctor.

5
00:00:12,321 --> 00:00:13,491
(Howard:)One free barium enema...

6
00:00:13,655 --> 00:00:16,195
(Howard:)...and my mother won't care
she's not Jewish.

7
00:00:17,701 --> 00:00:20,331
(Leonard:)Wait a minute, so the eye patch
and the insults worked?

8
00:00:20,495 --> 00:00:23,955
(Howard:)No, there were three other guys
with eye patches. It was a fiasco.

9
00:00:25,625 --> 00:00:29,505
What did work was, "How'd you like to visit
a secret government facility?"

10
00:00:29,671 --> 00:00:31,671
(Sheldon:)So, what exactly do you want us to do?

11
00:00:31,840 --> 00:00:36,010
You help me get the rover out, and you get
Stephanie out before somebody notices.

12
00:00:36,178 --> 00:00:37,808
(Howard:)She doesn't exactly have clearance.

13
00:00:37,971 --> 00:00:40,561
(Sheldon:)Really? They don't let strange women
from honky-tonks...

14
00:00:40,724 --> 00:00:43,974
...play with $200 million
government projects on distant planets?

15
00:00:44,144 --> 00:00:48,194
(Howard:)Yes, I was bad. Maybe she'll spank me.
Can we please move on?

16
00:00:50,067 --> 00:00:53,607
Hey, Howard, it's getting late,
so do I get to drive this thing or what?

17
00:00:54,029 --> 00:00:56,369
(Howard:)Yeah, no, I'm sorry,
but something's come up.

18
00:00:56,531 --> 00:00:58,371
(Howard:)Kind of a Mars rover...

19
00:00:58,533 --> 00:01:02,123
Mars-rover-can-Howard-come-over...

